        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BTC20, Medium Duty Ball Tension Catch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMedium duty ball tension catches are mostly used on cabinet doors where a high end appearance is required or for heavier duty applications than a magnet catch can handle. May also be used on furniture, cabinet doors, closets, or other lightweight doors. Easily adjustable tension and packaged with matching finish mounting screws. Made of solid brass they are available in 9 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BTC20-Specifications.gif?v=1704354686\" width=\"600\" height=\"129\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BTC20  Ball Tension Catch\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-small-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc10\"><b>Small Ball Tension Catch</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-ball-tension-catch-deltana-btc30\"><b>Large Ball Tension Catch</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Deltana BTC20 Ball Tension Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Max Length: 2-5/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Tension</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BTC20.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BTC20 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
